        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Placeholder_Image_c03b17da-7c45-410c-95f0-ed970f35e0fa.png",
        "subheading": "",
        "title": "<p>“When I first got my dog, Stella, I tried everything...</p>",
        "heading_highlight_type": "circle",
        "heading_size": 130,
        "text_content": "Classes, private trainers, hours of YouTube—nothing stuck. Every walk was a battle. Every command felt like a gamble. And then she ran away.\nWhen I finally got her back, I hired a trainer who handed me a shock collar and told me to “correct her fear.” That’s when I knew: this wasn’t the kind of help we needed.\n\nOut of desperation, I tried virtual training—and everything changed.\nIt focused on our bond, our environment, and my confidence as much as hers. For the first time, it worked.\n\nThat experience led me to start Homeschool—a new kind of support system for dog parents like me.\nCalm, clear, personal—and built around real life.\n\nWith my trainer, I finally had a clear plan, grounded in calm, consistent support—for both of us. Today, training feels good. Our bond is strong. And our home? Peaceful. \n\n- Gabriela, Founder",
        "text_alignment": "left",
        "button_text": "Book Your Free Behavior Call →",
        "button_link": "shopify://pages/free-consultation-booking-page",
        "button_style": "btn--primary",
